# Original description (presenter-editable, idempotency anchor)
la herencia opaca de un proyecto sin dueño: fragmentos de sistema desconectados, versiones que se superponen y una ruta de recuperación aún por construir

# Enriched generation prompt (what image generation consumes)
Create a portrait editorial vector-style symbolic illustration for a presentation aside. It should evoke the opacity and disorder of an inherited ownerless project: overlapping obsolete fragments, disconnected systems and one incomplete route toward recovery. Use a flat poster-like visual language, light ground, dark #3B3535 structural masses, one sparing #DA1B2E accent, thin contour lines and strong white negative space. No readable text, letters, numbers, logos, UI, dashboards, charts, photorealism, literal offices, people, furniture, buildings, shadows, watermarks or signatures.
